{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0GWH", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$2$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{S}'$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0007": "$$\n\\Mor_{\\textit{Fib}/\\mathcal{C}}(\\mathcal{S}, \\mathcal{S}')\n$$", "MATH_0008": "$1$", "MATH_0009": "$2$", "MATH_0010": "$2$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-fibred-categories-over-C}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:dce948261445d9e80ab8fef91da8008e440f88e9c04cc1d35b0a428ffbb976e5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:55a84b9014a68520f330dc03cc0a9f019e8693f5b33d4cbe607ae61e63320973", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a category. The <MATH_0002>-category of fibred categories\nover <MATH_0003> was constructed/defined in\nDefinition <REF_0001>.\nIf <MATH_0004>, <MATH_0005> are fibred categories\nover <MATH_0006> then\n<MATH_0007>\ndenotes the category of <MATH_0008>-morphisms in this <MATH_0009>-category.\nHere is the <MATH_0010>-category analogue of the Yoneda lemma\nin the setting of fibred categories.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:263594a2b0e40c39bf6d621a494e9c1eebbb1d3c29e5f01d06c5d84d1fdd7cfc", "unit_id": "tag:0GWH:prose-0001"}
